{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2fe5e449e7236c2954bb526a00650dbce8a9f9c023f70c87a3154b768f68edd3", "ja": "（未来が、リゾートウェディングのイベントに\n出演する事になった。衣装もウェディング風だ！）", "zh": "（未来受邀参加度假婚礼的活动。\n服装也是采婚纱风格！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "3a07f5937df441e121a73c0c1103a0f555750479a93c78ea1e31faab19fa598a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　えっと、\n新しい衣装着てみたんですけど、どうですか……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n那个，我试穿了一下新服装，你觉得怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ca2d8afbad2e859084cd1641192e2b4adb06ce2a41e3897d209762c1c04a9fd8", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\nうん、バッチリだ。よく似合ってる！", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n嗯，非常棒，很适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "f29002371ce60f060c9166e3a1c74ce4ebe2dfba05b546d99ebd357f23a49437", "ja": "本当ですか！？　でへへ……\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你的夸奖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "3ec603f4f0322cd6e84768aada3dc9d0f1b2f315036bd6ed2d928f8a59b58511", "ja": "すっごくカワイイ衣装がもらえて、私、\nとっても、とーってもうれしいです！", "zh": "收到这么可爱的服装，\n我非常非～常高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1005_p", "source_sha256": "409558158e4faed5188f4bcdc340e75d24cd79bfdfd4c889eefca6b7a449ff0c", "ja": "うん、思った以上によく似合ってるよ。本物の\n花嫁さんみたいだな！　ちょっと若すぎるけど……。", "zh": "嗯，比想像中的还要适合你，看起来就像\n真的新娘似的！虽然有点太年轻了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "912376225fcfad68bc45852d2b809d3319ffc3a1aa983a77aa0be6b4e2105931", "ja": "そんな～、本物の花嫁さんだなんて～……！\nえへ、えへへへへ……♪", "zh": "唉唷～居然说人家像真的新娘～！\n嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "fcad68107d644ac0ebafd55a27346f5988580e5dc1f59df15d7d55666add824e", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんに似合うって\n言ってもらえて、ホッとしました！", "zh": "不过，听到{$P$}先生说适合我，\n真的让我松了一口气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "3549b9e0097847a2e6ce5482a0250baf4440b207748b9e65852edf906be6e2e2", "ja": "私、ウェディングドレス……じゃなくて、ウェディング\nドレスみたいな衣装着るの、初めてですから！", "zh": "因为这是我第一次穿婚纱……更正，\n是类似婚纱的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1009_p", "source_sha256": "80e78f76152b92d3c4c8f11e158d6533072b460c74245478af987d8fe033c231", "ja": "確かに未来くらいの年だと、結婚なんて言われても、\n具体的なイメージが湧かないかもしれないな。", "zh": "的确，在未来这个年龄，就算跟你说结婚什么的，\n你可能也很难有什么具体的想像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "786153905bee7f36d7af62e64102d9b5b893b33d09497efee72433c9ef79355c", "ja": "そうなんですよね～。結婚って、\n好きな人とするものだっていうけど……。", "zh": "就是说啊～人家都说，\n结婚要找自己喜欢的对象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "83e75cdc0d8777eda9d69132af9bb75b1a20b1316998b19ae6627c54bf9facab", "ja": "でも静香ちゃんや翼みたいな好きとかじゃなくて、\nもっと、も～っと、好きじゃないとなんですよね？", "zh": "但不是像对小静和翼那样的喜欢，\n而是更深更～深的那种喜欢对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1012_p", "source_sha256": "36a5f7daf8678135fbfb348f35419d0df6917af9af402cfdb1490208bca91274", "ja": "そうだな……俺もうまく説明できないけど、\n友達への好きとは、違うんだろうな。", "zh": "这个嘛……我也不太会解释，\n但应该是和对朋友的喜欢不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1378969416a57c9f37dd74355c22ae5df8f2dcc5f3e79d0c493901fc25a127c6", "ja": "でも未来が結婚するとなると、大変そうだな！\nそれに、アイドルを続けるのも、大変になるかも……。", "zh": "不过未来如果要结婚，感觉不是那么容易呢！\n而且，可能也很难继续偶像活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "813d4e458d1e4954b221749fd232bb7872d8aa9756343fa84bb05c145a065c9c", "ja": "あ、そうですよね！　それじゃあ結婚のことは、\n私がアイドルじゃなくなってから、考えます！", "zh": "啊，说得也是呢！那结婚的事情，\n等我不当偶像以后再来考虑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2ca089fddee3441e14b5134489c2bcd51b08b089e2bfc94baa012398905dcbdd", "ja": "はは、そうしてくれると助かるけど……\nでもいいのか？", "zh": "哈哈，你愿意这样我是很开心……\n但你确定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "debe43e28fd80aa93f053e46eb3da854626d7cc37bf0e477e8d6385ba26f7612", "ja": "はい！　だって私、アイドルのお仕事、\nずーっと続けたいですから♪", "zh": "嗯！因为我想要一～直当偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "09eb2208549bed08a1f8154250ce2637a26ed540528c109cf795253b10153f48", "ja": "だから{$P$}さん、\n私のこと、ずーっとプロデュースしてくださいね！", "zh": "所以{$P$}先生，\n你也要一～直当我的制作人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07f075e208c7018441bb2e4440075249634fd35f489f624def6166c329773f4f", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。いつかそんな日が来るまで、\n未来の事を、ずっとずっとプロデュースするよ。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是，在那天到来以前，\n我会一直培育未来你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0134_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0134_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "bc9b42b8fffa7f58a743f1ab07fdb0fdc52a28f511645646627c91838e56d0f3", "ja": "やった♪　約束ですからね、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "太好了♪一言为定喔～\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
